// The `core/net/http` conformance package, for the half a server writes by
// hand: repeated header fields, cookies, form bodies, status lines and content
// types — plus the bound a request carries.
//
// `semantics/http.buri` is the other half, and it is about the *types*:
// `Request` and `Response` as values, their fields, their equality and their
// `show`. This one is about what the module does with them.
